Rhine Personal Archive

This project is a local, single-user personal dossier, evidence review and resume
workspace. It includes interface and Three.js scene work derived from RhineLabUI.
The upstream MIT copyright and license text is preserved in LICENSE.

MiSans font files and related metadata retain their own notices and license files
under public/fonts. Other bundled third-party dependencies and browser resources
remain subject to their respective licenses. The project MIT license does not
replace those resource licenses.

Source attribution and adaptation records are documented in
docs/SOURCE-ATTRIBUTION.md, docs/source-fingerprints.json and
docs/rhine-scene-fingerprints.json.

Release packages do not include a personal library, private originals or a claim
that any imported biographical material has been verified.
